        </span>

        <h3>
          Atelier technique territorial
        </h3>

        <p>
          Réparer, reconditionner, produire et maintenir localement.
        </p>

        <span class="dashboard-card-link">
          Consulter le prototype →
        </span>

      </div>

    </a>


    <a
      href="/membres/prototype/2"
      class="dashboard-card"
    >

      <img
        src="/action/module2.png"
        alt="Exploitation polyculture-élevage"
      >

      <div class="dashboard-card-content">

        <span class="dashboard-card-number">
